{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","不休撕咬"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","连续攻击一名敌人，并使其无法回复生命值并持续受到伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","狂暴地连续攻击一名敌人，持续击飞这名敌人并造成10段60% + 10% ATK伤害，最后一击造成200% + 20% ATK伤害并将敌人击倒，每段伤害额外附带敌人已损失生命值6%的伤害，且额外伤害最高不超过自身120%攻击力。本技能释放期间，哈拉克处于霸体状态，命中敌人后使敌人不能回复生命值，持续6秒，期间该敌人每秒流失40% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":126,"end":128,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":161,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","连续攻击造成的伤害提升至70% + 10% ATK，最后一击造成的伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","连续攻击造成的伤害提升至80% + 10% ATK，最后一击造成的伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","连续攻击造成的伤害提升至90% + 10% ATK，最后一击造成的伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","连续攻击造成的伤害提升至100% + 10% ATK，最后一击造成的伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","迅猛鲨袭"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","快速位移至最虚弱的敌人脚下对其造成伤害并击飞。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","潜入水中，快速移动至最虚弱的敌人身下，对其造成220% + 25% ATK伤害并击飞1格。哈拉克在水中会处于无敌状态，且参与击败角色会立即重置“迅猛鲨袭”的冷却时间。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":54,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至250% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","吞食欲望"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时获得“暴食”效果大幅提升战斗能力，参与击败角色会刷新“暴食”效果时长。“暴食”效果结束时，哈拉克会不分敌我地吞食一名英雄。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，战斗开始时，哈拉克获得“暴食”效果，暴击提高35 + 6点，急速提升50点，持续12秒，参与击败角色会刷新“暴食”时长。\n哈拉克在“暴食”状态结束后会失去理智，不分敌我地吞食一名全场最虚弱的非召唤物角色，使其立即被击败，吞食期间自身处于霸体状态。吞食的敌人的当前生命值最多不超过哈拉克200% ATK。在挑战首领的模式中，哈拉克在尝试吞食友军时，会优先将初始站位靠前的友军作为目标。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":95,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":122,"end":124,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":146,"end":154,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“暴食”效果附带的暴击提升至40 + 6点。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“暴食”效果附带的暴击提升至45 + 6点。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“暴食”效果附带的暴击提升至50 + 6点。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身生命汲取，参与击败角色后生命汲取获得额外提升。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身生命汲取提升8点，每参与击败1名角色，额外提升1点，最多提升4点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身生命汲取提升10点，每参与击败1名角色，额外提升2点，最多提升8点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身生命汲取提升12点，每参与击败1名角色，额外提升3点，最多提升12点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","噬体消化"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","参与击败角色提升哈拉克的攻击力和最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","哈拉克参与击败角色时，获得该角色60%的攻击力和60%的最大生命值，累计最多获得自身220%的基础攻击力和自身220%的基础最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","累计最多获得自身240%的基础攻击力和自身240%的基础最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","累计最多获得自身260%的基础攻击力和自身260%的基础最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","哈拉克参与击败角色时，还会立即回复生命值，回复量等同于被击败角色50%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","参与击败若干角色后，释放终极技能返还一定能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","哈拉克参与击败2名角色后，释放终极技能返还700点能量。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","噬欲之剑"]]}